# .gcloudignore — exclusions for `gcloud builds submit` source uploads.
#
# `gcloud builds submit` does NOT honor .dockerignore — it uses .gcloudignore,
# falling back to .gitignore if .gcloudignore is absent. The Dockerfile copies
# everything under the build context, so without this file gcloud uploads the
# full repo (including node_modules / .next / .terraform), which on this repo
# is ~3 GB. Keep this in sync with .dockerignore for the application bits, and
# add infra/ide/secret exclusions specific to gcloud uploads below.

# ── Dependencies & build output (also in .dockerignore) ─────────────────────
node_modules
.next
.next/cache
out
dist
build
coverage
.jest

# ── Logs & lock noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ── Env & secrets (NEVER upload these) ──────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# ── VCS & IDE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.husky
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
*.swp
*.swo
*.swn
.DS_Store

# ── Tests ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.playwright-mcp
tests
playwright-report
playwright.config.ts

# ── Docs ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
docs

# ── Infrastructure (huge — Terraform state + provider plugins) ──────────────
# Exclude all of infra/ and infra-gcp/ by default, EXCEPT infra/database/schema/
# which the migration-runner image (Dockerfile.migrate) needs as build context.
# Pattern: exclude infra/**, then re-include the specific directories along the
# path so gitignore-style traversal can reach the leaf files.
infra/**
infra-gcp/**
!infra/
!infra/database/
!infra/database/migrations.json
!infra/database/schema/
!infra/database/schema/**
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate*
**/.tfplan

# ── Claude / agent worktrees ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude
